{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110406001:1":{"text":"조심해. 이곳은 블랙하울의 소굴이야.","source_cn":"小心点。这里就是他们的老巢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A0F55A5A18F8CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110406002:1":{"text":"아르사, 저들이 공격하면, 내 뒤로 숨어...","source_cn":"阿尔萨，如果他们发难，就躲进我身后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80B55ABB7B3ADC4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110406003:1":{"text":"소렌, 돌아온 것을 환영해! 그리고 아르사도! 두 트라이브 용사의 이름이 벌써 온 사막에 퍼졌다고!","source_cn":"索恩，欢迎回归！还有阿尔萨！两位蛮血勇士的英名已经传遍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A5476B5E30D7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110406003":{"text":"소렌, 돌아온 것을 환영해! 그리고 아르사도! 두 트라이브 용사의 이름이 벌써 온 사막에 퍼졌다고!","source_cn":"索恩，欢迎回归！还有阿尔萨！两位蛮血勇士的英名已经传遍了沙漠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A5476B5E30D7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110406004:1":{"text":"뭐지? 이렇게 잡혀 와서 이런 대우를 받다니...","source_cn":"怎么回事？我们被押送过来，实在没想到还能享受这种待遇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3BA194A68D17B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110406005:1":{"text":"...뭐라고? 잡혀 와?!","source_cn":"什么？押送？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E192DAD5B69DBEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110406006:1":{"text":"...이 멍청이들아! 틀렸잖아! 내가 “모셔”오라고 했잖아!","source_cn":"——你们这两个笨蛋，完全搞错了！我说的是“请”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04418DDDAF4FF89D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110406007:1":{"text":"이렇게 젊고 유망한 두 명의 용사에게... 특히 소렌에게 어떻게 이렇게 무례할 수 있어?","source_cn":"对这样两位年少有为的著名勇者——尤其是索恩，怎能如此粗暴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91007F7AEA60EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110406008:0":{"text":"죄송합니다 형님. 저희가 잘못했어요. 자진해서 벌을 받겠습니다!","source_cn":"对不起，大哥，我们错了。我下去自己领罚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE60F96BE7B3BAB73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110406009:1":{"text":"소렌, 미안미안! 사실 네가 고향으로 돌아와서 모두 기뻐하고 있어.","source_cn":"索恩，真抱歉！其实你回到家来，整个氏族都很高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A72DE99D2EA489","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110406010:1":{"text":"고향에 돌아오다니...? 무슨 뜻이죠?","source_cn":"回家？这是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE99084D3A5D6EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110406011:1":{"text":"그... 오우거 보스가 너를 직접 만나고 싶다시니 가서 자세히 이야기해보자!","source_cn":"这……奥格老大要亲自见你，到时候你们可以细说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x108771F49957BE0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"갑자기 이렇게 친절하다고?","source_cn":"突然好热情","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x00F118B2E21C3DE9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"갑자기 이렇게 친절하다고?","female":"갑자기 이렇게 친절하다고?","variant_male_record_index":"63678","variant_female_record_index":"63679","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"태도가 너무 다르잖아","source_cn":"好厉害的前倨后恭","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6167F8B66B3F8E7B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"태도가 너무 다르잖아","female":"태도가 너무 다르잖아","variant_male_record_index":"63680","variant_female_record_index":"63681","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:热情的黑嚎熊人":{"text":"열정적인 블랙하울 베어포크","source":"热情的黑嚎熊人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:挑衅的黑嚎守卫":{"text":"도발적인 블랙하울 수비병","source":"挑衅的黑嚎守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_coun